ΛSIM is a blueprint-simulation encryption engine that treats plaintext
as a dynamic simulation grid. Each encryption round applies field warps,
inertial cancellation, coherence folding, and round-key mixing.

ΛSIM-02 introduces nonlinear resonance twisting and dynamic grid scaling.

